WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.154
Hi! I'm Nina. Let's talk about food!

2
00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:07.762
I love pizza! I eat pizza every Friday.

3
00:00:10.012 --> 00:00:13.867
My brother Theo eats salad every day, but I don't like salad.

4
00:00:16.117 --> 00:00:20.110
My friends and I love ice cream and cake. Theo doesn't eat cake.

5
00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:25.843
My mother drinks tea. My father drinks coffee.

6
00:00:26.293 --> 00:00:29.033
I don't drink coffee. I drink juice.

7
00:00:31.283 --> 00:00:34.766
And you? Say the food you like and the food you don't like!

